合パッケージ化が進むほど、外部の助言や単純な監視機能は不要になる可能性もある。","commercialState":"既存記事のAI判断を維持。需要と採算の未確認事項が残る。","entryConditions":"既存メーカーの包括契約から外れ、第三者へ発注される仕事が実際にあるか。","evidenceStrength":"既存記事で取得した資料を参照。今回、当該市場の追加事実は取得していない。"},"citations":[{"claimId":"ai-power","claimText":"IEAはデータセンター電力需要の大幅増加をシナリオとして示す。建設決定や個別顧客の購買実績ではない。","kind":"source_assertion","title":"IEA Energy and AI","url":"https://www.iea.org/reports/energy-and-ai/executive-summary","publishedAt":null,"retrievedAt":"2026-09-10T11:54:48.179Z","capturedBy":"external_research_session","snapshotId":"9bfa900aecbc346b69e17881e68a5a19e5a1611b035c526d1eb909f205ca6ae1","bodyHash":"3fa3576449355f2a03dd51e9854c3638f46afffb31e90da32c622ce35f8ded89","normalizedTextHash":"54aead30975dbd0f471b9062b45979460c260d92c2feaefc66f69ab0d08f2c7f","normalizationVersion":"html-text-v2","start":7054,"end":7143,"sourceId":"iea","excerpt":"Data centre electricity consumption is set to more than double to around 945 TWh by 2030.","relationship":"context"},{"claimId":"incumbent-cooling","claimText":"Vertivは設置・試運転・継続保守を含む液冷サービスを発表している。新規参入者だけに空いた市場ではない。","kind":"source_assertion","title":"Vertiv Liquid Cooling Services announcement","url":"https://www.vertiv.com/en-in/about/news-and-events/news-releases/vertiv-announces-global-launch-of-liquid-cooling-services-portfolio--to-support-systems-for-ai-and-high-density-compute-applications/","publishedAt":null,"retrievedAt":"2026-09-10T11:54:49.306Z","capturedBy":"external_research_session","snapshotId":"62b0278ed611064c6dcf5a309dad19f19c74ddea5a7df7cf9031de31920e0aa7","bodyHash":"2b50ea1b70a4de6f132fd54e226cae798fd71a431cdaf0f69da399c6819820b9","normalizedTextHash":"8010804f5b70162f797d89200421acfca4b215fa2e3bd74db21e3deab43a14cd","normalizationVersion":"html-text-v2","start":7433,"end":7503,"sourceId":"vertiv","excerpt":"It includes expert installation and commissioning, ongoing maintenance","relationship":"contradicts"},{"claimId":"cooling-process","claimText":"提供者は計画・事前調整・現場確認・実施・完了報告の工程を説明する。","kind":"source